WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:06.839
- Wow.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:14.300
- A true selfless act
always sparks another.

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:40.166
(children laughing)

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:56.509
- Dear Mr. Klaus, instead of
stealing Mrs. Runa's berries

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.160
we picked them all up for her.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.030
She came to our house
later and she brought mom

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:03.233
lots of berry jam.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.947
And then mom brought her a berry pie.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:17.230
- Forgive me I'm kind of a dreamer but

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.723
isn't that why we do it?

00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:21.900
Why you became a teacher?

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.450
So you could make a difference?

00:02:24.464 --> 00:02:25.297
- Oh!

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.826
(chalk scrapes)

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.403
- There you go.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.910
- Really, that's my name?

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.170
- Yes, yay it's your name.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.360
- Wow, can you teach me more?

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.193
Please.

00:02:59.193 --> 00:03:00.910
- [School Children] Me next
I want to write my name.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.050
Pick me, pick me, teach
me how to write my name.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:12.710
♪ If happy lives a mile away ♪

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.792
♪ A couple steps is all it takes ♪

00:03:14.792 --> 00:03:18.687
♪ If kindness lives in everyone ♪

00:03:18.687 --> 00:03:21.920
♪ Then all it takes is standing up ♪

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:26.920
♪ Can't touch it, see it ♪

00:03:27.022 --> 00:03:32.022
♪ But you can always feel it ♪

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:37.170
♪ The greatest things you never ♪

00:03:56.944 --> 00:04:00.777
- (speaking foreign language)

00:04:08.829 --> 00:04:11.956
- (speaking foreign language)

00:04:11.956 --> 00:04:15.789
- (speaking foreign language)

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.676
♪ Can't touch it ♪

00:04:21.676 --> 00:04:23.759
♪ See it ♪

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:26.540
- [Klaus] Delivering these toys,

00:04:27.418 --> 00:04:30.140
seeing the joy they bring to children,

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.707
I thought I'd never feel this again.

00:04:32.707 --> 00:04:34.133
- [Young Man Voiceover]
What am I supposed to do?

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.300
Stay forever in this little town?

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.950
Hanging out with an old woodsman.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.593
Surrounded by crazy people.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.050
Never wanting anything more.

00:05:33.571 --> 00:05:34.404
- Mine?

00:05:43.001 --> 00:05:44.423
- [Long Haired Girl] So
when you go to sleep,

00:05:44.423 --> 00:05:45.256
and when you wake up in the morning,

00:05:45.256 --> 00:05:47.270
the present is right
there by the fireplace.

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:48.770
- Ya Mr. Klaus is amazing.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:51.230
- [Little Girl] Ya he's awesome.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.620
- Klaus, awesome?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.190
- He's huge, but he can
squeeze down any chimney.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.210
- Really, how?

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.823
- I don't know, magic I guess.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.917
- [Little Girl] Oh and he likes cookies

00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:09.167
don't forget to leave out some cookies.

00:06:20.555 --> 00:06:22.138
- He came, he came!

00:06:23.659 --> 00:06:25.326
- Mines the big one.

00:06:27.605 --> 00:06:30.186
- I told you, I told you he would come!

00:06:30.186 --> 00:06:32.719
- Mom, come here quick!

00:06:32.719 --> 00:06:35.052
Yes it's just what I wanted.

00:06:40.756 --> 00:06:44.423
(excited children cheering)

00:06:51.631 --> 00:06:53.131
- I'm coming love.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.370
- [Voiceover] I stopped
trying to make sense of it

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.677
a long time ago.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.490
What I do know is that once a year

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.110
I get to see my friend.

